---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/maps.css";
---

<Layout title="キャンパスマップ｜学祭ポータル">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-title">
      <img src="/img/maps/maps.svg" alt="地図アイコン" class="page-icon" />
      <h1>キャンパスマップ</h1>
    </div>
    <button class="main-btn tutorial-btn" id="tutorial-btn-event-introduction">
      このページの使い方
    </button>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <h2 class="section-title">ご来場の際のご案内</h2>

  <a class="access-info" href="#" target="_blank">
    <div class="grid-container">
      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/img/maps/wheelchair.svg" class="access-info-icon" />
      </div>

      <div class="grid-item">
        <p class="grid-item-title">車いすスペース・優先席のご案内</p>
        <p class="grid-item-description">
          バリアフリー設備・優先席のご案内をご確認いただけます
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/img/maps/arrow.svg" class="arrow" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <hr />

  <a class="access-info" href="#" target="_blank">
    <div class="grid-container">
      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/img/maps/red-icon.svg" class="access-info-icon" />
      </div>

      <div class="grid-item">
        <p class="grid-item-title">Ichigaya Town Lens by C3</p>
        <p class="grid-item-description">
          市ヶ谷周辺の隠れた名所を巡るデジタルマップ、中大のサークル「C3」(本サイト開発元)が制作
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/img/maps/arrow.svg" class="arrow" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <img
      src="/img/maps/townlens.svg"
      alt="Ichigaya Town Lens"
      class="maps-image"
    />
  </a>
</Layout>
